   "text": "Too low: the answer stops mid-sentence (OpenAI marks it \"incomplete\").\nIt does not make the model smarter or shorter on purpose, it just cuts.",
   "originalText": "Too low: the answer stops mid-sentence (OpenAI marks it \"incomplete\").\nIt does not make the model smarter or shorter on purpose, it just cuts.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 5,
